 "traditions": [],
 "notes": "All nine planned kinds kept; old Dishwasher cleaner, Dishwasher freshener, Kettle and appliance descaler, Iron soleplate cleaner and Washing-machine cleaner merged into Appliance cleaner and descaler as types. Cream cleaner, antibacterial spray and scouring powder are types of Multi-purpose cleaner. Dropped trade/pro SKUs: Barrettine Knockout (descaler, mould spray), KilrockPRO limescale, degreaser and mould products, SCRUBB Mould Shield; bare 'Viakal' and 'Cillit Bang' duplicates removed. Models added only where a retrieved page or old data names the product (Wikipedia brand pages, finish.co.uk, dr-beckmann.com, hg.eu, clrbrands.com); generic names like 'Clorox bleach' are product lines, not SKUs. Brand entries for Cif, Method, Viakal, HG, Astonish, Cillit Bang, CLR, Finish, durgol and Dr. Beckmann left out (no page retrieved with country/founding facts; Cif and Finish Wikipedia titles 404, Cillit Bang redirects to Reckitt). Astonish, Viakal and Mould Magic not given models (unconfirmed product names). Calgon (water softener) belongs with laundry products, not here. No archetypes: tier shelf. Iron soleplate cleaner has no confirmed model."
}